      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It feels like there's an issue with the kicking logic here, as I think client 2 should get kicked. That way if someone manages to spoof the user ID and join the instance, they will be able to force-kick anyone by spoofing their user ID and joining on them. This is just a theory as I haven't looked at this more closely than having the idea just now, so it may be impossible to target people this way.",
